@startuml
[*] --> "Tracking Mood"
[*] --> "Mood Journal"

"Tracking Mood" --> "View Mood Graph" : After inputting emotions and selecting color
"View Mood Graph" --> "Tracking Mood" : Return to track more moods
"View Mood Graph" --> [*] : Exit Mood Tracker

"Mood Journal" --> "Search/Filter Notes" : After writing notes
"Search/Filter Notes" --> "Mood Journal" : Return to write more notes
"Search/Filter Notes" --> [*] : Exit Mood Tracker
@enduml
